cgWUmRJC8-qmlbSJtWmgPwwwEZO71urgRjQ1rV10ViP_CM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8SCJtj5eJRsTNgCqlvIWHiDLc1n9JAgQdiSIdBUgD7Ug&oe=6A394272"}, {"file_name": "ss2.png", "id": "296114026862324", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974517_296114030195657_275861733805151497_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZDSVYkx4HjkQ7kNvwHgla6v&_nc_oc=AdoLVrXNoDSpu25LrVDFJkdeoSO83KA9hw1Tk5HhYN6a5oSqBLPCCdn7cjgtFGgOUrs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af83KMEzFaQ0JZifmuvXZ-rSzAZquLebC1XLQZFrX9Y6bQ&oe=6A394DA1"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "802537541948419", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210889_802537548615085_7583608226087987807_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6loJBEPAKw0Q7kNvwGD8RDB&_nc_oc=Adr8uj2rCxWF9E-pdRVOSdhQ0L_grEooYGOtT_OXH-a5njG3lVS2nZOnZXyiHce550s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8lpXeb6WRd7ZUCal7_LTb78qfYAXSsp98fuCGqNH7ajg&oe=6A39436E"}, {"file_name": "ss3.png", "id": "1952004381931095", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75298472_1952004385264428_8213665801664121384_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pegHrT_OL58Q7kNvwGA8r-Z&_nc_oc=AdrrmGVCST-o0XQmmr8-AmhWVfSzdiI9JPYFpCYQ1cf55XfbuyBbncjXwD3pWTxGbXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af99OmcJKLnKlb8JRKU0mlSoKn_4WZI_Y48umG53ryG8rg&oe=6A39616C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "7841830009239208", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035410_7841830012572541_6800934679758716826_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8__IFN5CfwkQ7kNvwG9Wu-c&_nc_oc=Adp4DYUsvHAkcSAFr0gDvkzi2EwRsEgAbs5WfaKgD2tkA26yYfj2FfNII5hkyll31uo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9q8VbWsPRP2FjfKQJXC7BJrxM6cAp32Hh0e7ARjumoRQ&oe=6A395593"}, "display_name": "Orb Conquest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges.\nGameplay Overview\n\nIn \"Orb Conquest,\" players are transported to a visually stunning, high-tech environment filled with neon-lit paths and mesmerizing graphics. The game mechanics are designed to test and enhance your coordination and problem-solving skills. Each level presents a unique maze-like track, teeming with hurdles that require quick thinking and precise movements to overcome.\nKey Features\n\n    Dynamic Spheres: Master the control of highly responsive spheres, each with unique attributes and abilities that you can unlock and upgrade as you progress.\n\n    Intricate Tracks: Navigate through a variety of complex and beautifully designed tracks. Each track offers different challenges, from narrow passages to moving barriers and beyond.", "short_description": "Orb Conquest: The Ultimate VR Experience\n\nDive into the exhilarating world of \"Orb Conquest,\" a cutting-edge VR game that challenges your precision, reflexes, and strategic thinking. Set in a futuristic realm where you control dynamic spheres, your mission is to navigate these spheres through intricate tracks and lines, overcoming a series of increasingly complex obstacles and challenges."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "SGag2426 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/orbconquest", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "con